sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor User as 用户
    participant Catalog as 官方 HTTPS 目录
    participant Center as 原厂 App Center
    participant NVS as 原厂 NVS
    participant Setup as Setup
    participant Menu as Mooncake 主菜单
    participant SDK as ESP-IDF OTA
    participant DSH as 配套 DSH.AGENT
    Catalog-->>Center: SC1 应用 ID 和镜像摘要
    User->>Center: SC2 首次下载或打开已安装镜像
    Center->>SDK: 校验镜像，选择待启动槽
    SDK-->>Center: 选择成功
    Center->>NVS: 复核原厂和候选，存两份摘要
    opt SC3 修改可见性
        User->>Setup: 设置 App Visibility
        Setup->>NVS: 写独立显示开关
    end
    Menu->>NVS: 读取显示开关
    User->>Menu: SC4 点击 DSH.AGENT
    Menu->>NVS: 读取启动记录
    alt 本地记录、镜像和两个槽状态均匹配
        Menu->>SDK: 重验并选择待启动槽
        SDK->>DSH: 原版启动器加载候选
        User->>DSH: SC5 Home
        DSH->>Menu: 释放资源，原版回滚后进入主菜单
    else 缺记录、摘要失效或系统更新在途
        Menu-->>User: 留在状态页，Home 回菜单
    end
